# Theme-INVARIANT markers for the per-theme kitchen-sink walkthrough.
#
# `cargo xtask record themes --check` generates one VHS tape per
# gpui-component theme that launches the real `rstui-kitchen-sink` binary
# under `RSTUI_THEME="<name>"`, walks all 21 screens via the command
# palette, opens the settings drawer, and quits. For every theme it then
# asserts each marker below is present in the capture, PLUS the theme's own
# name (added in code — the launch echo is on a `target/debug/` line which
# the matcher excludes, so a pass means the settings drawer actually
# rendered the chosen theme's name).
#
# Each screen marker is a fragment of that screen's `title()` — which the
# header renders ONLY for the active screen (the sidebar shows the short
# label, so a label would match even without navigating; a title fragment
# genuinely proves the walkthrough reached that screen). One marker per
# line; blank lines and '#' comments ignored.

# Chrome, always rendered: brand + footer command hint.
rstui
palette

# One title() fragment per screen, in walkthrough order.
rstui kitchen sink
focusable controls
trees, tabs
calendars, diffs
alerts, toasts, spinners
blocks, grids, scrolling
Markdown, Mermaid
truecolor
channels, threads
three-pane email client
explorer with tree
KPIs, charts, activity
playlist, seek, transport
buffer, problems
live preferences
inputs with live validation
move cards across columns
streaming, filtered tail
OTel golden signals
distribution, heatmap
flame graph, attributes
